docs {
  # Get All Product Riset
  
  ## API Endpoint
  `GET /api/product-riset/all`
  
  **Auth Required:** ✅  
  **Role Required:** All authenticated users
  
  ---
  
  ## Response Structure
  
  ### Success (200)
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "message": "Berhasil mengambil semua product riset",
    "data": [
      {
        "id": "uuid-1",
        "nama_produk": "Aplikasi Mobile",
        "createdAt": "2025-01-15T10:00:00.000Z",
        "updatedAt": "2025-01-15T10:00:00.000Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "uuid-2",
        "nama_produk": "Prototipe Hardware",
        "createdAt": "2025-01-15T10:00:00.000Z",
        "updatedAt": "2025-01-15T10:00:00.000Z"
      }
    ]
  }
  ```
  
  ---
  
  ## Error Responses
  
  | Status | Message |
  |--------|--------|
  | 401 | Token tidak valid |
}
